Root cause not yet confirmed. Permission issue ruled out (Data Load user is a System Admin). Failures seem to occur around the 6 AM ETL load, Tuesday to Saturday (per Anita and Ero), and may be related to concurrency with the load. The error email shows only a generic Salesforce message, so the real error needs a debug log.
Related: PLIG-7648 adds the admin distribution email to the notification, so future failures can be investigated right away.



PLIG-7619 - SPIKE: Household Owner Auto-Assignment Based on Relationship Ownership
Technical Feasibility

The requirement is feasible.

Investigation confirmed:

Household records are stored as Account records with the Household Record Type (4,289 Households in Production).
Related Business and Individual Accounts are linked to the Household using the lookup field CRM_Customer_Household__c.
Households where all related Accounts are owned by the same user can be identified.
Ownership mismatches currently exist (see examples) and can be corrected automatically.

Recommended solution: a monthly Scheduled Batch Apex process.

Findings
Household Relationship Structure
Business / Individual Account
        |
        |  CRM_Customer_Household__c (Lookup)
        v
Household Account
